Dante® support
--------------
The Dante control protocol ("ARC", UDP 4440) is not publicly documented. The packet layouts used in
custom_components/av_matrix/protocols/dante.py follow the reverse-engineering work of the netaudio project
(network-audio-controller) by Christopher Ritsen and contributors:

    https://github.com/chris-ritsen/network-audio-controller

netaudio is released into the public domain under the Unlicense. The logic was re-implemented in this project;
no netaudio code is included. tests/dante_sim.py contains a few response packets from netaudio's test fixtures
(tests/fixtures/issue_59/later_pages.json) and reference request bytes from its core_commands_golden.json.

