Fonts
-----
custom_components/av_matrix/frontend/fonts/ contains Atkinson Hyperlegible Next and Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono
(Braille Institute of America; sources: https://github.com/google/fonts, ofl/atkinsonhyperlegiblenext and
ofl/atkinsonhyperlegiblemono), subset to Latin / Latin-1 and converted to WOFF2. They are licensed under the
SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 - see custom_components/av_matrix/frontend/fonts/OFL.txt. The card serves them
from the integration itself; no external font service is contacted.

